  "details": "I have a generally slow internet. I have strict safety settings and I show avatars one by one. I've had multiple times where I win the lottery and start downloading a 200mb avatar and suffer. They also add insult to injury by quickly switching between multiple big avatars, all of which I would have to download. Download priority is coming up and that's great but wouldn't solve this particular issue.",
